            <a class="btn btn-line btn-lg" href="/compatibility">Check your router compatibility</a>
          </div>
          <p class="related">
            See also:
            <a href="/blog/wireguard-site-to-site-vpn-how-it-works-2026/">WireGuard for site-to-site VPN: how it actually works</a> ·
            <a href="/blog/branch-office-vpn-smb-rollout-playbook-2026/">Branch office VPN: a 5-phase rollout playbook</a> ·
            <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a> ·
            <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
